    "upstreamScenario declares outcomes owned by upstream packages (T1 resolution, V0 realization, P0 plan compile, E1 export) as scenario inputs, the same idiom as the U1 quick-entry packet's declared t0Result inputs. The validator judges U7's derivation from those inputs; the static test cross-checks the declared upstream codes against the live upstream vocabularies.",
